  "features": [
    "adds Projects / Knowledge as top-level Workspace views",
    "derives a device-local cross-project index from canonical Workspace Objects",
    "searches project title, object title, summary, content, tags, provenance title, and provenance URL locally in the browser",
    "filters knowledge by object type, project, tag, and active/archived project scope",
    "adds reusable cross-project collections that store stable project/object references rather than copied object content",
    "shows provenance and internal reference counts for indexed objects",
    "surfaces related work using transparent deterministic signals: shared tags, same source URL, and same provenance title",
    "opens indexed objects back in their canonical originating project",
    "cleans collection references when projects or objects are deleted",
    "exports a portable knowledge collection JSON package",
    "keeps project schema at 10.0 while advancing workspace storage from schema 12 to 13",
    "retains the canonical Knowledge Library route /knowledge-libraries/"
  ],
